  Text: |-
    LevelManager (script component of Level_Container)
    uses first 2 level prefab's childs to determine infoboard
    and ball starting positions. When level loads the ball will be
    placed in the prefab topmost child's position. The infoboard
    will be placed in the prefab second topmost child's position.
    Make sure that you have these 2 childs positioned in your
     prefab proberly!
